<!doctype html><html lang="${r.metadata.language}"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"><title>WebAuditJ</title><h1>WebAuditJ</h1><h2>${l("初めて読む方へ", "Reading this for the first time?")}</h2><p><a href="executive-summary.html#quick-read">${l("まず、結果と次の対応を見る", "Start with the results and next steps")}</a></p><p>${l("最初の3項目で、見つかったこと・被害の確認状況・次にすることが分かります。詳しい証拠を確認する場合は技術者向け報告へ進んでください。", "The first three points explain what was found, whether damage is established, and what to do next. Use the technical report for detailed evidence.")}</p><p><strong><a href="suspicious-requests.csv">${l("不審アクセスのログ一覧を開く（CSV）", "Open suspicious access logs (CSV)")}</a></strong></p><h2>${l("詳しく調べる・資料を使う", "Details and supporting files")}</h2><ul><li><a href="executive-summary.html">${l("まず結果と次の対応を見る（やさしい要約）", "Start with results and next steps (plain-language summary)")}</a></li><li><a href="technical-report.html">${l("技術者向け報告", "Technical report")}</a></li><li><a href="technical-report.html#secondary-investigation">${l("二次調査プロンプト生成", "Secondary prompt generator")}</a></li><li><a href="report-spec.md">Report specification</a></li><li><a href="report.json">JSON</a></li><li><a href="README.md">README</a></li><li><a href="manifest.json">Manifest</a></li></ul></html>